        <item>
            <title>1.2.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 01 Nov 2025 10:08:36 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://picmal.app/</link>
            <sparkle:version>30</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <enclosure url="https://picmal.app/apps/picmal/updates/1.2.1/Picmal.dmg" length="97752882" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="RhBZwS/0q2oTXBzy5US6Gi68dd1DCFVW9bVSFq8l9kgQfMXwifXfXupI+Siy4CyVCKcKXUKVxu11VieF1qADCg=="/>
        <description><![CDATA[<div><ul><li>Batch resize images with 5 flexible modes (percentage, fixed, max</li>
  dimensions, width/height-only).</li>
<li>Display metadata for audio and video files (duration, bitrate, codec,</li>
  sample rate).</li>
<li>Advanced mode for audio and video with enhanced FFmpeg controls.</li>
<li>Fixed PDF compression corrupting colors in Keynote/PowerPoint</li>
  presentations.</li>
<li>Compressed files now automatically include "_compressed" suffix.</li>
<li>Improved format support (31 audio, 25 video formats).</li></ul></div>]]></description>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.2.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 30 Oct 2025 17:23:36 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://picmal.app/</link>
            <sparkle:version>29</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <enclosure url="https://picmal.app/apps/picmal/updates/1.2.0/Picmal.dmg" length="97478855" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ptE+z65Vbh2QXP1KV0PfF0syFtqjKgAkK7Am8IPx0MIE8S+vOdS3jlziwTJxljDMEVGbmrr2souKt21hSEv9Bw=="/>
        <description><![CDATA[<div><ul><li>Support audio formats: MP3, WAV, AAC, M4A, FLAC, OGG, OGA, WMA, OPUS, M4R, AC3, WV, FSSD, AU, SPH, GSRT, CVS, CVSD, CAF, SPX, IRCAM, SND, CVU, VOC, VMS, PRC, AMB, DTS, TTA, 8SVX, DVMS, SNDR, VOX, SD2, HTK, SOU, W64, SLN, TXW, SMP, RA, SNDT, HCOM, FAP, CDDA, PAF, MAUD, MP2, WVE, NIST, AIFF, AIF, AIFC, AVR, IMA, PVF.</li>
<li>Support video formats: MP4, MOV, AVI, MKV, WEBM, FLV, WMV, M4V, MPG, MPEG, 3GP, M2TS, MTS, VOB, ASF, OGV, WTV, TS, MJPEG, M2V, HEVC, F4V, MXF.</li></ul></div>]]></description>
        </item>
